;; db: bench_hub_closing
;; Moderate version of hub_tri: T closes the triangle for k=60 of the n
;; spokes, so the filter keeps k*n of the n^2 intermediate pairs -- a big
;; class win rather than total elimination, with NON-EMPTY output (checks
;; that pruning never drops real derivations).
table (redge int int)
table (sedge int int)
table (tedge int int int)
table (tri int int int)

rule (redge A B) (sedge B C) (tedge C A W) --> (tri A B C)
